  "lyrics": {
    "rawText": "I step into the beat like a door swung wide,  \nThe night leans in with a knowing pride.  \n\nThe floor is warm with a polished shine,  \nEach moving shadow keeps perfect time.  \nThe bassline speaks in a rounded tone,  \nIt laughs out loud but it’s fully grown.  \n\nWhat the funk, let the moment decide,  \nLet the colors spill, let them collide.  \nWhat the funk, feel the pulse align,  \nEvery step says this beat is mine.  \n\nA sideways glance, then a subtle grin,  \nThe rhythm pulls every dancer in.  \nNo heavy words, just space to move,  \nThe truth is hiding inside the groove.  \n\nWhat the funk, let the moment decide,  \nLet the colors spill, let them collide.  \nWhat the funk, feel the pulse align,  \nEvery step says this beat is mine.  \n\nWe drop it down till the room breathes slow,  \nThen snap it back with a brassy glow.  \nNo explanation, no second guess,  \nThe funk arrives fully self-possessed.  \n\nWhat the funk, hear the ceiling rise,  \nSee reflections dance in your eyes.  \nWhat the funk, stay until it’s done,  \nWhen the night resets, we’ve just begun.  \n\nThe groove rolls on, no need to fade,  \nA loop of joy that we gladly made.  \n"
  },
